# [DIR] §6.6 Case $QJ$: $\frac14\le x\le\frac12\le y\le1$, $x+y\ge1$

This file was automatically generated by Claude.

Source [DIR]: P. Durcik, P. Ivanisvili, J. Roos, *Sharp isoperimetric inequalities on the Hamming
cube near the critical exponent*, arXiv:2407.12674v2 (revised version, August 2026), §6.6.

This file covers the introduction of §6.6, §6.6.1 (near diagonal; Proposition 6.11 and the
